\cf0 The report also uses the same cross-validation folds for tuning and model comparison, which can make the CV results optimistic. The held-out test comparison suggests a small HGB improvement, but I would describe that gain as modest rather than conclusive. The report identifies log transforms of skewed features as untested; a future run could compare them in cross-validation. The page limit is a presentation constraint, not evidence about whether a transform would improve performance.\
